      "created_at": "2019-08-12T20:05:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"morph147\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/839c29/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> morph147:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Was any updates given about primewar at gen con</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/gencon-2019-19436\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/gencon-2019-19436</a></p>\n<p>I played a co-op version of Prime War and wrote a bit about it. Prime War was mentioned as a ‘medium’ goal. No specific dates mentioned. Not definitely planned by next Gencon.</p>",
