    {
      "id": 228384,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-08-13T14:24:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks everyone! A few notes/answers:</p>\n<p>1) \"March\" was a copy-paste error. I have changed it to \"July\" :)</p>\n<p>2) This Gen Con went more smootly because we've learned a lot of lessons and project managed it better. We still have a number of improvements to make for next year!</p>\n<p>3) We definitely plan to post most, if not all, of the RPG Core Rulebook chapters in the Playtesting forum for feedback!</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:02:51.754Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 19354,
      "topic_slug": "state-of-gtg-august-2019",
      "display_username": "Paul",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "Judges",
      "flair_url": "scale-balanced",
      "flair_bg_color": "7700ff",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 42,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": "Chief Justice",
      "title_is_group": false,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Thanks everyone! A few notes/answers:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1) \"March\" was a copy-paste error. I have changed it to \"July\" :)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2) This Gen Con went more smootly because we've learned a lot of lessons and project managed it better. We still have a number of improvements to make for next year!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3) We definitely plan to post most, if not all, of the RPG Core Rulebook chapters in the Playtesting forum for feedback!</p>",
